    "_comment": "Route-A native-skeleton retargeter config (mydata2 -> hightorque_pi_plus). mydata2 is a Y-up (Mujoco) standard-centimetre BVH. Spine hierarchy: Hips->Spine->Spine1->Neck (no Spine2/3). ik_map uses Spine1 where mydata used Spine3. scaler / offsets must be calibrated via the in-app Calibration panel.",
